  "result": "Done! I've added line management functions to src/invoices.js:\n\n**New exports:**\n\n1. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds a new line or increases qty if the SKU already exists:\n   - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with the line appended or updated\n   - Validates qty and sku like `createInvoice` (error codes: `QTY_INVALID`, `UNKNOWN_SKU`)\n   - Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n\n2. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line by SKU:\n   - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` without that line\n   - Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n   - Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n   - Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n\n**New error codes added to ERRORS:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 No line item with that SKU on the invoice\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 Only draft invoices can be modified\n\n**Test coverage:**\n\nAdded 13 new tests covering:\n- Adding new lines and updating existing SKUs\n- Preserving other lines and properties\n- Validation of qty and SKU\n- Draft status enforcement\n- All error conditions\n- Non-mutation of input\n\nAll 48 tests pass \u2705",
